# Response headers for the static site, copied to the root of the build by an
# afterBuild listener in bootstrap.php (Jigsaw skips files whose name starts
# with an underscore, so it cannot live in source/).
#
# Every page is also published as Markdown (/fr/tarifs.md). Cloudflare serves
# those as text/markdown with nosniff, which a browser downloads instead of
# showing, so "View as Markdown" saved a file. As text/plain it is shown as
# written, and an assistant reads the same bytes either way.
#
# They are noindex because each one repeats a page that is already indexed, in
# the same language, so a search engine would weigh the two against each other.
# noindex does not stop anything from fetching them: an assistant still reads
# them, and /llms.txt still lists them.
/*.md
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex

# /llms.txt describes the whole site for a language model. The head of every
# page links to it already; the same relation as a header reaches an agent
# that reads headers and never parses the HTML. Relative, so a preview points
# at its own copy rather than at production.
/*
  Link: </llms.txt>; rel="alternate"; type="text/plain"; title="llms.txt"
